partition "Similarity Computation" {
:Adaptive Similarity Calculation;
note right
```python
      def calculate_adaptive_similarity(e1, e2):
          base_sim = cosine_similarity(e1.composite_embedding, e2.composite_embedding)
          adjustments = []
          if e1.domain == e2.domain: adjustments.append(0.1)
          if abs(e1.timestamp - e2.timestamp) < 3600: adjustments.append(0.05)
          if e1.visual_group == e2.visual_group: adjustments.append(0.08)
          final_similarity = min(base_sim + sum(adjustments), 1.0)
          return final_similarity
```
end note
}

partition "Clustering" {
:Distance Matrix + Clustering;
note right
```python
      n = len(ui_elements)
      distance_matrix = np.zeros((n,n))
      for i in range(n):
          for j in range(n):
              if i != j:
                  distance_matrix[i][j] = 1.0 - calculate_adaptive_similarity(ui_elements[i], ui_elements[j])       # HDBSCAN or Agglomerative Clustering with auto-threshold
      cluster_labels = HDBSCAN(metric='precomputed', min_cluster_size=3, min_samples=2).fit_predict(distance_matrix)
```
end note

:Calculate Cluster Confidence;
note right
```python
  cluster_confidences = {}
  for cluster_id in set(cluster_labels):
      if cluster_id == -1: continue
      members = [i for i,lbl in enumerate(cluster_labels) if lbl==cluster_id]
      intra_sim = np.mean([1-distance_matrix[i][j] for i,j in combinations(members,2)])
      cluster_confidences[cluster_id] = intra_sim
```
